{% comment %}
@description: Chan trang.
@required_substrings: site.siteName, footerMenu, year
@required_ids:
@notes: Nhan bien site, footerMenu (giong header.liquid) va year (nam hien tai, dung cho dong ban quyen). Link "Chính sách bảo mật"/"Điều khoản dịch vụ"/"Hướng dẫn xoá dữ liệu" hardcode toi /p/privacy, /p/terms, /p/data-deletion - day la QUY UOC co chu dich (khong tra theo Page that trong DB), admin PHAI tu tao 3 trang tinh (page.liquid) voi slug dung "privacy"/"terms"/"data-deletion" thi 3 link nay moi co noi dung, neu khong se ra 404. Trang tinh (page.liquid) luon nam duoi prefix "/p/<slug>", KHONG PHAI "/<slug>" - xem routes/public/pages.ts ("/p/:slug"). Cot "Lien he" dung dung cac truong that tu SiteConfig (settings-general.liquid): site.companyName (ten phap nhan day du, khac site.siteName la ten thuong hieu ngan), site.contactEmail, site.contactPhone, site.contactAddress, site.businessLicense - PHAI bao {% if %} cho TUNG truong vi tat ca deu optional/co the rong (chua tung dien), khong duoc gia dinh luon co du lieu. Icon mang xa hoi (site.socialLinks JSON {facebook,zalo,tiktok,youtube} - xem routes/admin/settings.ts) dat o cot "Brand" (dau tien, duoi tagline) - KHONG dat o cot Lien he (da chuyen theo yeu cau). "Khám phá"+"Hỗ trợ" duoc boc trong 1 div "grid grid-cols-2 md:contents" de hien 1 hang 2 cot tren mobile nhung van tro thanh 2 item rieng cua grid cha o desktop (giu dung bo cuc 4 cot ngang hang). Bo cuc mo phong chatbot-lite/web/src/components/PublicLayout.tsx (PublicFooter) nhung thay cong ty hardcode bang du lieu dong cua tenant.
{% endcomment %}
<footer class="bg-brand-dark px-6 pb-10 pt-20 text-white/70 relative overflow-hidden">
    <!-- Decorative background -->
    <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-96 h-96 bg-brand-light/5 rounded-full blur-3xl transform translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 pointer-events-none"></div>

    <div class="mx-auto max-w-[1200px] relative z-10">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-12 md:grid-cols-4 md:gap-8">
            <!-- Brand -->
            <div class="pr-4">
                <div class="mb-6 flex items-center gap-3 text-lg font-bold text-white">
                    {% if site.logoUrl %}
                        <img src="{{ site.logoUrl }}" alt="{{ site.siteName }}" class="h-10 w-10 rounded-xl object-contain bg-white/10 p-1">
                    {% else %}
                        <span class="h-10 w-10 rounded-xl bg-brand flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold text-lg shadow-lg">{{ site.siteName | slice: 0, 1 }}</span>
                    {% endif %}
                    {{ site.siteName }}
                </div>
                <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/60 font-medium italic">"Xinh Đẹp - An Toàn - Hiệu Quả"</p>
                <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/60">{{ site.tagline | default: "Thương hiệu mỹ phẩm thiên nhiên an toàn cho mẹ bầu và da nhạy cảm." }}</p>

                {% if site.socialLinks.facebook or site.socialLinks.zalo or site.socialLinks.tiktok or site.socialLinks.youtube %}
                    <div class="mt-8 flex items-center gap-3">
                        {% if site.socialLinks.facebook %}
                            <a href="{{ site.socialLinks.facebook }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Facebook" class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white/5 border border-white/10 text-white/70 transition-all hover:bg-[#1877f2] hover:border-transparent hover:text-white hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-[0_4px_12px_rgba(24,119,242,0.3)]">
                                <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M18 2h-3a5 5 0 0 0-5 5v3H7v4h3v8h4v-8h3l1-4h-4V7a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h3z"/></svg>
                            </a>
                        {% endif %}
                        {% if site.socialLinks.zalo %}
                            <a href="{{ site.socialLinks.zalo }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Zalo" class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white/5 border border-white/10 text-[13px] font-bold text-white/70 transition-all hover:bg-[#0068ff] hover:border-transparent hover:text-white hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-[0_4px_12px_rgba(0,104,255,0.3)]">Zalo</a>
                        {% endif %}
                        {% if site.socialLinks.tiktok %}
                            <a href="{{ site.socialLinks.tiktok }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="TikTok" class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white/5 border border-white/10 text-[13px] font-bold text-white/70 transition-all hover:bg-black hover:border-transparent hover:text-white hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-[0_4px_12px_rgba(255,255,255,0.1)]">TikTok</a>
                        {% endif %}
                        {% if site.socialLinks.youtube %}
                            <a href="{{ site.socialLinks.youtube }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="YouTube" class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white/5 border border-white/10 text-white/70 transition-all hover:bg-[#ff0000] hover:border-transparent hover:text-white hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-[0_4px_12px_rgba(255,0,0,0.3)]">
                                <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M2.5 17a24.12 24.12 0 0 1 0-10 2 2 0 0 1 1.4-1.4 49.56 49.56 0 0 1 16.2 0A2 2 0 0 1 21.5 7a24.12 24.12 0 0 1 0 10 2 2 0 0 1-1.4 1.4 49.55 49.55 0 0 1-16.2 0A2 2 0 0 1 2.5 17"/><path d="m10 15 5-3-5-3z"/></svg>
                            </a>
                        {% endif %}
                    </div>
                {% endif %}
            </div>

            <!-- Khám phá + Hỗ trợ -->
            <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-8 md:contents">
                <!-- Footer Menu -->
                <div>
                    <h4 class="mb-6 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-white">
                        Khám phá
                        <div class="h-0.5 w-8 bg-brand-light mt-3 rounded-full"></div>
                    </h4>
                    <ul class="space-y-4 text-sm">
                        {% if footerMenu and footerMenu.items.size > 0 %}
                            {% for item in footerMenu.items %}
                                <li><a href="{{ item.url }}" class="text-white/60 hover:text-brand-light transition-colors flex items-center gap-2 group"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/20 group-hover:bg-brand-light transition-colors"></span>{{ item.label }}</a></li>
                            {% endfor %}
                        {% else %}
                            <li><a href="/products" class="text-white/60 hover:text-brand-light transition-colors flex items-center gap-2 group"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/20 group-hover:bg-brand-light transition-colors"></span>Sản phẩm</a></li>
                            <li><a href="/blog" class="text-white/60 hover:text-brand-light transition-colors flex items-center gap-2 group"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/20 group-hover:bg-brand-light transition-colors"></span>Blog</a></li>
                            <li><a href="/cart" class="text-white/60 hover:text-brand-light transition-colors flex items-center gap-2 group"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/20 group-hover:bg-brand-light transition-colors"></span>Giỏ hàng</a></li>
                        {% endif %}
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <!-- Support -->
                <div>
                    <h4 class="mb-6 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-white">
                        Chính sách
                        <div class="h-0.5 w-8 bg-brand-light mt-3 rounded-full"></div>
                    </h4>
                    <ul class="space-y-4 text-sm">
                        <li><a href="https://account.leadbase.vn" class="text-white/60 hover:text-brand-light transition-colors flex items-center gap-2 group"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/20 group-hover:bg-brand-light transition-colors"></span>Tài khoản</a></li>
                        <li><a href="/p/privacy" class="text-white/60 hover:text-brand-light transition-colors flex items-center gap-2 group"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/20 group-hover:bg-brand-light transition-colors"></span>Chính sách bảo mật</a></li>
                        <li><a href="/p/terms" class="text-white/60 hover:text-brand-light transition-colors flex items-center gap-2 group"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/20 group-hover:bg-brand-light transition-colors"></span>Điều khoản dịch vụ</a></li>
                        <li><a href="/p/data-deletion" class="text-white/60 hover:text-brand-light transition-colors flex items-center gap-2 group"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/20 group-hover:bg-brand-light transition-colors"></span>Hướng dẫn xoá dữ liệu</a></li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Contact -->
            <div>
                <h4 class="mb-6 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-white">
                    Liên hệ
                    <div class="h-0.5 w-8 bg-brand-light mt-3 rounded-full"></div>
                </h4>
                <ul class="space-y-4 text-sm text-white/60">
                    {% if site.companyName %}
                        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-white/5 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 border border-white/10 text-brand-light mt-0.5">
                                <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M6 22V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v18Z"/><path d="M6 12H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h2"/><path d="M18 9h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v9a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-2"/><path d="M10 6h4"/><path d="M10 10h4"/><path d="M10 14h4"/><path d="M10 18h4"/></svg>
                            </div>
                            <span class="pt-1 font-medium">{{ site.companyName }}</span>
                        </li>
                    {% endif %}
                    {% if site.contactEmail %}
                        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-white/5 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 border border-white/10 text-brand-light mt-0.5">
                                <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect width="20" height="16" x="2" y="4" rx="2"/><path d="m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7"/></svg>
                            </div>
                            <a href="mailto:{{ site.contactEmail }}" class="pt-1 hover:text-brand-light transition-colors">{{ site.contactEmail }}</a>
                        </li>
                    {% endif %}
                    {% if site.contactPhone %}
                        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-white/5 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 border border-white/10 text-brand-light mt-0.5">
                                <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 .7 2.81 2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z"/></svg>
                            </div>
                            <a href="tel:{{ site.contactPhone }}" class="pt-1 font-bold text-white hover:text-brand-light transition-colors">{{ site.contactPhone }}</a>
                        </li>
                    {% endif %}
                    {% if site.contactAddress %}
                        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-white/5 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 border border-white/10 text-brand-light mt-0.5">
                                <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/></svg>
                            </div>
                            <span class="pt-1 leading-relaxed">{{ site.contactAddress }}</span>
                        </li>
                    {% endif %}
                    {% if site.businessLicense %}
                        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-white/5 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 border border-white/10 text-brand-light mt-0.5">
                                <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 2v20l2-1 2 1 2-1 2 1 2-1 2 1 2-1 2 1V2l-2 1-2-1-2 1-2-1-2 1-2-1-2 1Z"/><path d="M14 8H8"/><path d="M16 12H8"/><path d="M13 16H8"/></svg>
                            </div>
                            <span class="pt-1">Số ĐKKD: {{ site.businessLicense }}</span>
                        </li>
                    {% endif %}
                    {% if not site.companyName and not site.contactEmail and not site.contactPhone and not site.contactAddress and not site.businessLicense %}
                        <li>{{ site.domain }}</li>
                    {% endif %}
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-16 flex flex-col items-center justify-between gap-4 border-t border-white/10 pt-8 text-xs text-white/50 md:flex-row">
            <p>&copy; {{ year }} {{ site.siteName }}. Thiết kế dành riêng cho bạn.</p>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
                <img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/ba/Stripe_Logo%2C_revised_2016.svg" alt="Stripe" class="h-5 opacity-50 hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity" width="48" height="20">
                <img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a4/Paypal_2014_logo.png" alt="PayPal" class="h-4 opacity-50 hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity" width="60" height="16">
                <img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5e/Visa_Inc._logo.svg" alt="Visa" class="h-3 opacity-50 hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity" width="38" height="12">
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</footer>
